                <pb facs="0480" n="470" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg470"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2 in No. 5.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Washburn to the
                        American Consul.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Boston,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-12-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 9, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Steamer Chesepeake taken by pirates is on your coast. Give all information you
                    may have immediately to collectors of Portland, Boston, and Eastport.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>I. WASHBURN, <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jr.,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Collector of Portland.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
